(Section 2: Hallucination Rates and Verifiability) '
(Fine-tuned models still hallucinate in 18% of domain-specific edge cases because facts) '
(are stored implicitly in weight distributions.) '
(RAG solves this by forcing the model to cite exact source excerpts and page numbers.) '
() '
(Contrasting Perspective on Page 2:) '
(While fine-tuning is superior for teaching specific linguistic styles or strict code formats,) '
(RAG is the undisputed standard for document discovery, compliance, and factual research.) '
ET
endstream
