(Section 3: Hybrid Deployment Guidelines) '
(The ideal enterprise architecture combines a fast, compact foundation model \(such as) '
(gemini-2.5-flash\) with dynamic RAG vector indexing.) '
() '
(Operational Conclusions:) '
(1. Use RAG for real-time document search, Q&A, and policy adherence.) '
(2. Avoid static fine-tuning when source PDFs change weekly or monthly.) '
(3. Enable multi-document comparative indexing to detect discrepancies across contracts.) '
ET
